/fieldset><label>AI provider for new booking documents<select name="document_ai"><?php foreach(['openai'=>'OpenAI','gemini'=>'Google Gemini']as$p=>$label):?><option value="<?=$p?>" <?=booking_document_provider($cfg)===$p?'selected':''?>><?=e($label)?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><p>Visitors explicitly consent to the provider shown on their form. Existing documents keep their consented provider.</p><fieldset><legend>Meeting types</legend><?php foreach(comm_types()as$k=>$t):$saved=$cfg['types'][$k];?><div class="comm-type-setting"><strong><?=e($t['name'])?></strong><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled_types[]" value="<?=$k?>" <?=!empty($saved['enabled'])?'checked':''?>>Available to visitors</label><p>All requests require a briefing report and your approval.</p><label>Duration (minutes)<input type="number" name="minutes[<?=$k?>]" value="<?=(int)$saved['minutes']?>" min="15" max="120" step="15"></label></div><?php endforeach;?></fieldset><label><input type="checkbox" name="worker" <?=!empty($cfg['worker'])?'checked':''?>>Enable booking service emails, reminders and my opted-in device alerts</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <?=!empty($cfg['enabled'])?'checked':''?>>Accept bookings on my public booking page</label><button class="wbtn primary">Save availability</button></form></section><aside class="comm-panel"><h2>Booking email identity</h2><p><a class="wbtn" href="<?=url('/write/booking-mailboxes')?>">Connect and manage matching sender mailboxes</a></p><h2>Destination calendar</h2><p>Connect a separate booking grant, then confirm an owned calendar. New invitations are written only there. Your eight existing read connections stay separate.</p><form method="post" action="<?=url('/write/connections/google_booking/start')?>"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn">Authorize booking calendar</button></form><p><a href="<?=url('/write/connections#google_booking')?>">Confirm or review booking destination →</a></p><p>Configure this exact redirect URI in Google Cloud:</p><code class="comm-code"><?=e(publishing_callback_url('google_booking'))?></code><h3>How availability works</h3><p>Selected calendars are checked live. A required connection failure stops bookings. Requests awaiting approval also reserve their proposed time.</p><p>Google Meet links are created with confirmed bookings. Zoom, Teams and Webex hosting remain available through Meeting accounts.</p><p class="comm-muted">Working hours and suggested meeting types are initial defaults. Booking stays closed until you enable it.</p></aside></div>
